+## Integration with rsync Test Suite
+
+### Automatic Discovery
+The rsync test runner (`runtests.py`) automatically discovers tests matching `*_test.py` pattern in the `testsuite/` directory.
+
+### Test Naming Convention
+- `zos-ccsid-conversion_test.py` - Core functionality
+- `zos-ccsid-performance_test.py` - Performance benchmarks
+- `zos-ccsid-regression_test.py` - Regression tests
+
+### Skip on Non-z/OS
+All tests check `platform.system() != 'OS/390'` and skip automatically on non-z/OS systems using `test_skipped()`.
+
+### Dependencies
+All tests use the standard `rsyncfns` module for:
+- Path management (FROMDIR, TODIR, SCRATCHDIR)
+- rsync execution (run_rsync, rsync_argv)
+- Test utilities (test_fail, test_skipped)
+- File operations (makepath)
