+## Troubleshooting
+
+### Common Issues
+
+**"chtag command not found"**
+- Install z/OS file tagging utilities
+- Ensure PATH includes /bin
+
+**"iconv command not found"**
+- Install z/OS iconv utilities
+- Ensure character conversion support is enabled
+
+**"Transfer failed with exit code 23"**
+- Check rsync error messages
+- Verify file permissions
+- Check CCSID tag on source file
+
+**"Content mismatch after conversion"**
+- Verify source file is valid UTF-8
+- Check CCSID tag with `chtag -p file`
+- Review hex dump of destination
+
+**Performance tests timeout**
+- Increase disk I/O resources
+- Check for disk space issues
+- Consider running on faster storage
+
+### Debug Mode
+```bash
+# Run with debug output
+RSYNC_DEBUG=all ./runtests.py -v testsuite/zos-ccsid-conversion_test.py
+```
