+## Test Maintenance
+
+### Adding New Tests
+1. Create new `*_test.py` file in `testsuite/`
+2. Import from `rsyncfns`
+3. Add platform check: `if platform.system() != 'OS/390': test_skipped(...)`
+4. Use standard test utilities
+5. Document in this file
+
+### Modifying Existing Tests
+1. Update test code
+2. Update expected results in this documentation
+3. Run full test suite to verify no regressions
+4. Update CRITICAL_FIXES_SUMMARY.md if behavior changes
+
+### Test Data Generation
+Tests create their own data in `FROMDIR` (from) and verify in `TODIR` (to).  
+Scratch files go in `SCRATCHDIR`.  
+All cleaned up automatically after test run.
